<p>RMG = Real Monetary Gap.</p>
<p>On the basis of the exchange rates from January 11 to 16 1997 the RMG for the pound is above +5 percent, at +9.534 percent. Therefore, the UK green rate is currently forecast to revalue on January 21, 1997 to 0.769374 by halving its average RMG. Since the halving of the UK&quot;s RMG creates a negative threshold of -0.233 (9.534/2)-5), all currencies with negative average RMG's below this level will be delvalued at the end of this confirmation priod. Thus the Dutch green rate is currently forecast to devalue on 21 January 1997. During confirmation periods the three day (6 percent) rule is suspended.</p>
